    "Wide": "宽",
    "Within each group, models share a weekly limit and a 5-hour limit. Quota is consumed proportionally to the cost of the tokens. Thus, limits will last longer with shorter tasks or using more cost-effective models. The 5-hour limit smooths out aggregate demand to fairly distribute global capacity across all users, while your weekly limit is tied directly to your individual tier.": "同一组内的模型共享每周配额和 5 小时配额。配额按 Token 成本比例消耗，因此任务越短或模型越经济，配额可使用越久。5 小时配额用于平抑总体需求，从而在所有用户之间公平分配全局容量；每周配额则与您的订阅级别直接相关",
